  "title": "LFT Reports 2024 Results and Quarterly Dividends",
  "summary": "NEW YORK, March 19, 2024 /PRNewswire/ — Lument Finance Trust, Inc. (NYSE: LFT) (“we”, “LFT” or “the Company”) today reported its fourth quarter and full year 2024 results. GAAP net income attributable to common shareholders for the fourth quarter was $3.6 million, or $0.07 per share of common stock, and for the full year was $17.9 million, or $0.34",
